# Month reconcile session (`/spending/reconcile`)

Dedicated triage page: stage **multiple** statement uploads for one month, auto-match against manuals, review queue, confirm once.

## Storage

`spending.reconcile_sessions["YYYY-MM"]` — `{ report_month, status, auto_match_ran, uploads[], excluded_manual_ids[], kept_manual_ids[], reviewed_unclaimed }`.

Each upload: `{ id, file_name, bank_source, period_start, period_end, rows[] }`. Row: `{ id, date, description, amount, direction, category, include, manual_match, transfer_pair, ledger_duplicate }`.

## Match kinds (`manual_match`)

- `single` — 1 bank row → 1 manual
- `netted_manuals` — 1 bank row → N manuals (exact sum)
- `netted_banks` — N bank rows → 1 manual (shared `group_key` on every leg)

## API routes

- `GET /spending/reconcile` — page
- `GET /api/spending/reconcile/<month>` — session payload (rows, manuals, totals, queue)
- `POST .../upload` — extract file → append upload. Form: `file`, optional `bank_source`, optional `period_start` / `period_end` (defaults to full month).
- `DELETE .../upload/<id>`
- `POST .../auto-match` — fuzzy + forward/reverse net + transfer pairs
- `POST .../link-manual`, `.../unlink-manual`, `.../link-transfer`, `.../unlink-transfer`
- `PATCH .../row/<id>` — `{ include, direction }`
- `POST .../exclude-manual`, `.../keep-manual`, `.../review-unclaimed`
- `POST .../confirm` — requires `auto_match_ran`; if unclaimed manuals remain, requires `reviewed_unclaimed`

## Helpers

`_reconcile_ensure_session`, `_reconcile_run_auto_match`, `_reconcile_session_payload`, `_reconcile_confirm_session`, `_home_statement_months`, `_is_manual_spending_tx` (legacy empty `source` = manual).

## UI (`@templates/reconcile.html`, `@static/reconcile.js`, `@static/style.css`)

Single card, not nested panels: header (title + month + status on one row) → statements composer → tally strip → triage card.

- `.reconcile-page .hidden { display: none !important }` — required because triage/tally/toolbar use `display: flex`/`grid`/`inline-flex`, which otherwise beat Tailwind `.hidden`.
- Composer: custom file control (`#reconcile-file-name`) so source / file / Add share a 2.5rem row. Collapsed **Adjust date range** (`#reconcile-range-toggle`) under the composer. Toolbar: auto-match left, **Continue to review** (`--primary` filled) on the right.
- `status == imported` is read-only (`session.readonly`, `body.reconcile-readonly`) — composer, toolbar, and triage hidden; tally + view-all remain.
- Match rows are a comparison grid (role · name · amount · date · source) so bank/manual amounts line up. Actions live in `.reconcile-triage-foot` on the same card as the match.
- Empty queue / bulk-accept / view-all must use `.hidden`; do not leave an empty triage husk on the staging screen.
- `#reconcile-view-all-toggle` expands a row table in the workspace (not a stray footer button).
- Triage queue (not three-pane). Second pass for unclaimed manuals (keep / exclude). `bank_matched_via`: `reconcile_auto` | `reconcile_user`. Excluded manuals get `reconcile_excluded_month` on confirm.

